Common Analysis Tasks
Quick Diagnostics:
•	Water too old? Filter for > [threshold] hours
•	Contamination spread? Use chemical analysis with animation
•	Source identification? Run tracer from suspected sources
•	Problematic pipes? Filter for high headloss or low pressure
Comprehensive Studies:
•	System-wide water age: Run full analysis, export results
•	Contingency planning: Analyze multiple contamination scenarios
•	Infrastructure planning: Compare different routing options
•	Regulatory compliance: Document water quality parameters
